safeshell (1.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: native btrfs and ZFS snapshots for undo;
    undo plans for apt install and systemctl stop, disable and mask;
    big folders are sized and simulated on disk or not simulated;
    an installed llama-server can be used offline; misspelled
    settings are reported; small loose files in partly mirrored
    folders are seen; one AppArmor profile per binary.

